1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,343
And that is the answer to our bouncing ball.

2
00:00:02,343 --> 00:00:08,828
The ball's neat, ordered energy spreads into the jiggling of countless molecules in the floor.

3
00:00:08,828 --> 00:00:10,520
Entropy rises.

4
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:15,911
The backwards film would need the entropy of the universe to fall, so it never plays.

5
00:00:15,911 --> 00:00:18,502
The second law gives time its arrow.

